   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Finds every face and hand in the input picture and redraws each one sharper and cleaner (Impact Pack FaceDetailer:\nYOLO face / hand detectors + SAM masks), then pastes them back. The rest of the picture is untouched.\nPrompt: describe the person (\"young woman with freckles, smiling\"); it applies to each face / hand.\nFix faces denoise 0.4 (0.25 = subtle, 0.5 = new face). Fix hands denoise 0.45; hands are hard, try a few seeds.\nDetection: Bbox threshold 0.5 (lower finds smaller / partial faces); Bbox crop factor = how much around the face is redrawn.\nUse the same checkpoint family as the picture (this one: SDXL). Leave Wildcard empty.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 20 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
